---
TDL: 0.1
Shell: 0.1
Name: Label
---

# A single line of text, not editable (Standard Modules > Label). It is a Text, so its look is the
# Text's: `Label { Foreground: ..., Font_Size: ..., Overflow: ELLIPSIS }` in a stylesheet restyles
# it, and `Label:disabled` styles it while `Enabled: false`. A text wider than the Label is cut
# (`Overflow: CLIP`, the default) or ends with an ellipsis; give the Label a `Width` (a common key
# of every module call) to make it narrower than its text. The text is also the Label's accessible
# name. A slot updates the text in place, with no rebuild.
Module {
    Params {
        Text { Type: string, Default: "" }
    }
    Text {
        Text: {{ params.Text }}
        Label: {{ params.Text }}
        Wrap: NONE
    }
}
